        "Content": "Renowned & Well-Established Bar & Restaurant\nPrime Town Centre Location\nExcellent Trading Figures\nTurnkey Business Opportunity\nThriving Family-Run Business for Over 30 Years\nFully Equipped Commercial Kitchen\nSpacious Living Accommodation (4 Bedrooms, 2 Ensuite)\nCovered Smoking Area & Outdoor Seating\nSecurity System with 16 CCTV Cameras\nExcellent Potential to Expand the Business or Convert Overhead Accommodation (Subject to Planning Permission)"
